### Monitor Backend API - REST Client Tests
### Para usar: instale a extensão REST Client no VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@azureUrl = https://monitor-api.azurecontainerapps.io

### Health Check - Local
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### Health Check - Azure
GET {{azureUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Registros - Local
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registros
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Registros - Azure
GET {{azureUrl}}/api/registros
Accept: application/json

###

### Health Check do Controller - Local
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registros/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Swagger JSON - Local
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

###

### Test with Query Parameters (exemplo para futuras implementações)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registros?dataInicio=2024-01-01&dataFim=2024-12-31
# Accept: application/json

###

### POST Example (quando implementar Commands)
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/registros
# Content-Type: application/json
# 
# {
#   "observacao": "Novo registro via API",
#   "quantidade": 100
# }

###

### Test Error Handling
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registros/999999
Accept: application/json

###
